><span lang=\"EN-GB\">TCF4</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 489pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"652\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">TCL1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 489pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"652\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD303</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 489pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"652\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD304</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 18cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-si